msgid ""
"Формат с **$** — стандарт `JsonPath "
"<https://goessner.net/articles/JsonPath/>`_."
msgstr ""
"The **$** format is the `JsonPath "
"<https://goessner.net/articles/JsonPath/>`_ standard."
